OL,3,ASudan's healthcare system on brink of
OL,4,Acollapse after cuts, medical charity
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FSudan's fragile health system is on the
OL,8,Fbrink of collapse as global funding
OL,9,Fcuts have led to the closure of
OL,10,Fhealthcare facilities across the
OL,11,Fcountry, Medecins Sans Frontieres (MSF)
OL,12,Fhas warned.
OL,14,FDozens of organisations were unable to
OL,15,Ffind alternative funding after the US -
OL,16,Fthe largest donor to Sudan - closed
OL,17,FUSAID, its body for delivering foreign
OL,18,Faid, last year, the medical charity
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
