OL,3,ASudan's healthcare system on brink of
OL,4,Acollapse after cuts, medical charity
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FMSF urged world leaders gathering at
OL,8,Fthe UN General Assembly in New York to
OL,9,Ftake action.
OL,11,FThe war that erupted in April 2023
OL,12,Fbetween the army and the paramilitary
OL,13,FRapid Support Forces (RSF) has created
OL,14,Fone of the worst humanitarian crises in
OL,15,Fthe world, with more than 33 million
OL,16,Fpeople needing medical assistance.
